WEBVTT

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:14.020
If I said I worked for the government,
you'd probably assume I work 9 to 5.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.090
But I often came home
from work at midnight.

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:20.660
Sometimes they called me into
the office in the middle of the night.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.870
That showed I was very competent
and even made me proud of myself.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.170
However...

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:32.350
One night when I came
home I found my wife had hung herself.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.940
On the suicide note
was written, "I'm lonely."...

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.690
That's why I'm going on
this pilgrimage as the atonement.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.150
This is my mom.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.060
She looks like a sweet person.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:52.760
Yes. She was very sweet.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.430
Who can it be, at this time of night?

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:06.580
Do you think you can
atone through your pilgrimage?

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:07.640
No.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:11.470
I won't be forgiven even if I go on
the pilgrimage for the rest of my life.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.420
But I just can't help that.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:17.020
What will happen to your daughter?

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.260
She will always be with me.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:23.130
We're going to look for mom, right?

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.320
Yes... that's right.

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.930
Well, come in and warm yourself.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:29.700
Thank you very much.

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:38.380
Reiha?

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:46.150
It's been a long time, Miyu.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.380
Oh? You two know each other?

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:34.600
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:38.600
and lead them to ruin.

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:44.240
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:52.380
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:56.260
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:03.100
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:08.360
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:12.760
No one knows her true face.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:46.570
Finding a nice place like this
has saved me a lot of trouble.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.610
I would imagine cold
weather has no effect on you.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.270
Oh, I do need a place to stay.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.540
With the way I look,
I could not have slept in the open.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.170
Why did you come?

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:59.980
My, how cold of you.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.580
I don't want to hear
that from a snow demon.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.720
What are you doing
in such a remote place?

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.890
Aren't there stray Shinma around?

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.520
I wouldn't know.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:12.490
You intend to get ahead
of us, but I won't let you.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:17.300
You are mistaken if you think
all Japan's stray Shinma are yours.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:21.270
Is that your true intention, Reiha?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.940
You want to hunt Shinma so much?

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:29.340
I didn't say any such thing.
Matsukaze is a bit outspoken.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.450
I'm not working as the
guardian because I like to.

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.050
If this is what you
want to do, then do it.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:36.890
Don't lie!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.850
You must be having fun!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.980
You enjoy beating Shinma!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.100
Matsukaze, it's time to go to bed.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:47.200
Your words haven't convinced me.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.570
There are far too many stray Shinma
in this world for you alone to handle.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.610
I won't let you have all the fun.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.670
You couldn't possibly
understand how I feel.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:20.430
Where did those two go?

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.570
They left early this morning.

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.040
I tried to stop them...

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:26.600
but they insisted on
going up into the mountains.

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.470
Is there anything up there?

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:32.940
Recently some people
went up, but never returned.

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:37.470
We searched the mountains,
but ended up finding nothing.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.680
She will always be with me.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.260
Don't tell me you're
going up there, too?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.290
If we leave now we may
be able to catch up to them.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:57.630
Don't be so reckless!

00:05:58.010 --> 00:06:00.270
You can't walk in the
mountains dressed like that.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.100
Please don't trouble yourself.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.010
We are used to this.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.560
We can't seem to find them.
We've walked quite a long ways.

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.070
He can't go too
fast with a small child.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:37.010
We should catch up to them.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:39.340
You want to help
these humans that much?

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.340
They've gone into
the mountains willingly.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.520
The child is innocent.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:46.580
You are so kind to children.

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.650
No, rather, too weak.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:50.750
I didn't ask you to come with me.

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:52.520
You can't get rid of us.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:54.720
A Shinma is somewhere here.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.020
We won't let you take
all the credit for yourself.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.230
Reiha, why are
you so willing to fight?

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.200
Are you serious?
Obviously, it's because...

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:08.170
Not you.
Reiha, you answer.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:13.210
When a Shinma performs an evil deed,
it causes trouble for beings like myself.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.970
In another words...

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:18.250
we don't want to be mistaken for
those Shinma who live off humans.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:19.580
How selfish.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:22.550
Then, why are you the guardian?

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:24.650
For the humans?

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.160
There is no reason... none...

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:00.220
How ironic!
The vampire gets her blood sucked.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:04.300
How sad...
Would you wait here for a moment?

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:14.530
Blizzard!

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.730
Now, it'll be easier for you to walk.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:12.590
Who is it?

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.130
Oh, are you two children
going through the mountains alone?

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.000
Have you seen a father
and daughter on a pilgrimage?

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:21.800
Nobody has passed by here.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:23.300
Are you sure?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:26.180
If you doubt me,
you can look around.

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:27.670
I will accept your kind offer.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:29.620
What is on this road ahead?

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.810
That is the only road leading
to the other side of the mountains.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:36.620
People go through before dark,
so, they usually don't stop here.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:37.460
I see.

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:39.930
You two must have started late.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:44.090
It will be dark soon, so
why don't you stay here tonight?

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:56.700
Thank you for a wonderful meal.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.070
It's time for
children to go to bed now.

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.240
Your beds are
prepared in the back room.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:05.010
Yes, ma'am, it is my bed time.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.590
Miyu,
I leave the matter to you.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:13.650
Goodnight.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.400
Goodness!
You've been attacked by leeches!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.100
It's fine.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.100
No, you can't leave them untreated.

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:32.680
Remove your clothes.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.900
The spring water of these
mountains helps heal wounds.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.600
Why are you so kind to me?

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.330
Even though I'm a Shinma, you mean?

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:06.610
Then you knew?

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.880
You are the guardian, right?

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:12.320
I've heard many rumors about you.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.150
If you want to seal me, I don't mind.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.330
Are you saying you're not
attached to this world anymore?

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.060
I'm no longer involved with humans.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.960
I enjoy my life here.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.430
I don't want to go
down to the village any more.

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:32.830
Is that true?

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:34.840
It's the truth.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.170
Come, and I'll show you the proof.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:12.040
What a beautiful moon.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.780
Come on out, everyone!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.170
Don't be afraid.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.330
All of them love me.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.130
Now you see.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.490
I'm happy enough,
as long as they are with me.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:13.430
I no longer need
to bother with humans.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:37.860
Welcome back.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.860
How did you fare with the Shinma?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.930
That's none of your business.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.270
Is that so?

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.740
I found this.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:56.340
Where?

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.890
It was in the livestock shed.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:04.220
This is your punishment
for trusting the Shinma.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.250
Now you understand your weakness!

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:09.090
Unforgivable!

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:47.900
I've baked some rice cakes.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:48.960
Help yourself.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.970
Thank you very much.

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:04.440
There's no point in waiting.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.020
What?

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:11.590
This food may work on humans
but it won't turn us into animals.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:13.420
How?

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.220
We know everything about your plot.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.860
"Sanjoushi of Hankyo."

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.570
A Chinese demon
who turns travelers into animals.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:28.110
I believe that's you.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.900
We may be of the same clan.

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:33.840
So the father and daughter on
pilgrimage did come here, didn't they?

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:34.910
Yes, they did.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:37.780
That man...

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.910
He said his wife
and I are exactly alike.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:17.020
That I looked just
like the girl's mother.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:20.580
So I arranged for
them to stay here forever.

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:22.260
By turning them into animals?

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:24.700
All the people love me.

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.930
So I let them stay with me.

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:28.590
What's wrong with that?

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:31.960
There are no horses in the shed,
but there are horseshoes.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.770
Did you sell them in town?

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.940
Or are you going to
make them work until they die?

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:41.070
You delude people's
minds and then enslave them.

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:46.250
Since you know so much,
I have nothing to say.

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:50.150
But I cannot let you leave either.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:17:00.100
EN-JYU

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:02.590
I have no intention of leaving.

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:08.830
At last you reveal your true form.

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:11.070
Now I shall kill you.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:15.110
No, let's watch how Miyu fights.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:15.910
Why?

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.640
Well, we may fight
against her someday.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:47.810
What's the matter?

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.500
Do you feel ill?

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.050
Out of... blood...

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:56.990
Water!

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.560
How would you like to try my water?

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:25.180
Will she die?

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.610
The Shinma is headed this way.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:41.930
Stray Shinma!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.870
My flame! Please work!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:54.340
I will never forgive someone like you!

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:57.380
How?

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.750
She shouldn't have any power left!

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:09.490
Everyone, come to me.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:10.390
I am...

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:19.040
Splendid job!

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:30.140
But, it's not over yet.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.800
They won't wake up, will they?

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:50.300
That's enough.

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:51.630
Let's go home.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:53.460
Why are you running away?

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:56.630
They're going to be animals
for the rest of their lives.

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:59.010
Why not just dispose of them?

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:02.470
But... they are humans.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:04.420
How weak!

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:17.830
No, Reiha!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.970
You can't make me stop.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:56.030
I'm very glad that you're safe.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.070
You should thank us.

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.860
We saved your life.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:08.010
Now that we are finished here,
we will be off.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:09.940
Please take care.

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:27.560
They looked nothing alike... not at all.

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:18.340
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:24.920
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:25.730 --> 00:22:31.360
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:39.270
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:43.970
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:47.840
I don't need friends.

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:48.680
That's a lie.

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:52.180
I don't even need myself.

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:52.950
It's the truth.

00:22:53.350 --> 00:23:00.990
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:08.870
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:16.270
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:19.550 --> 00:23:25.850
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:32.690
In my place, the sky cries.

00:25:05.320 --> 00:25:10.950
As time goes by, memories
fade into a soft sepia color.

00:25:11.530 --> 00:25:15.220
However, when a film which
has survived time is discovered...

00:25:15.860 --> 00:25:20.420
submerged passions resurface
becoming a distorted shadow...

00:25:20.500 --> 00:25:23.590
swallowing the hearts of dreamers.

00:25:24.640 --> 00:25:28.130
Next episode of Vampire Princess Miyu:
Sepia Colored Portrait.

00:25:29.210 --> 00:25:32.840
I don't know anything more
horrible than memories.
